You seek balance between fire and cold based on your current Psi level.

You blast your foes with [90, 121, 145, 165, 183 (TL1-5; MP 100; PSI 50%)] Fire damage based on your current Psi, [45, 60, 72, 83, 92 (TL1-5; MP 100; PSI 50%)] Cold damage based on your max Psi minus your current Psi, in a radius [2, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)] ball.

This sets your current Psi to half of your maximum Psi.

The damage scales with your Mindpower.
